          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            RMR-141 is a real, EPA-registered mold killer with a mild safety profile, and it works when you saturate the surface and keep it wet for the full 10 minutes. It does not remove stains, so pair it with RMR-86 on bleach-safe surfaces, sanding or primer.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Most of all, fix the water first and keep indoor humidity between 30 and 50 percent. The spray kills what is there today; the dehumidifier keeps it from coming back.
